WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.000
In the page editor, select the block you want to comment on.

00:03.000 --> 00:06.000
Click Comment on the block's toolbar. The Comments sidebar opens on that block.

00:06.000 --> 00:10.000
Type the comment and click Add comment.

00:10.000 --> 00:14.000
To comment on the whole page instead, choose Whole page.

00:14.000 --> 00:17.000
Show selects the block a comment is on.

00:17.000 --> 00:21.500
Resolve marks a comment done. Show resolved brings it back into view.
